{
  /*
   * The components every surface renders. Imports `@insyte/tokens` and `@insyte/domain` (the permission
   * catalogue the server also checks) and no surface, which is the direction ADR-0001 exists to forbid:
   * a surface may import this package, this package may not import a surface.
   *
   * The directory shape, and what is deliberately not here yet:
   *
   *   src/components/ the primitives — generated from the shadcn registry, then rewritten on Base UI
     *   src/lib/       `cn`, and anything else with no JSX in it
   *   src/brand/     the brand kit's pieces      — arrives with `apps/brand`
   *   src/marketing/ the landing page's sections, redesigned on these tokens (no longer a port)
   *   src/app/       the product: shell, every area's screens and parts, stores, hooks — moved from
   *                  `apps/console`, typechecked by the host (ADR-0026)
   *   src/data-source/ the seam those screens read their data through
   *   src/brand/book/ the brand book (`/brand`), rebuilt 1 November 2026 — typechecked by its host
   *   src/motion/    the token-bound transitions — arrives when something animates
   *
   * `motion` is named rather than created. An empty directory is a promise nobody can check, and it
   * would mean a dependency this package does not yet have a reason to carry.
   */
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.tsx"],
  // The ported code is its own project; see `tsconfig.ported.json` for why.
  "exclude": [
    "**/test/**",
    "src/brand/mark.tsx",
    "src/brand/marks.tsx",
    "src/lib/contact-email.tsx",
    /*
     * The product's screens, the seam and the brand book's chapters. They are typechecked by the
     * host that registers their route tree — `apps/design/tsconfig.json` and `tsconfig.brand.json`
     * include them by path — because a screen's `<Link to>` and `Route.useSearch()` are only typed
     * against a route tree, and only a host has one. Checked here, unregistered, every search
     * param would be `any`. A future `apps/console` includes them the same way.
     */
    "src/app/**",
    "src/data-source/**",
    "src/brand/book/**"
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "rootDir": ".",
    "tsBuildInfoFile": ".tsbuildinfo/src.tsbuildinfo",
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "types": []
  }
}
